1
00:00:00,301 --> 00:00:03,591
- All right.
- Go away.

2
00:00:05,931 --> 00:00:10,731
(Sheldon:)If you're concerned about sharing credit
with me, your name can go first... I'm going.

3
00:00:14,523 --> 00:00:16,943
(Howard(into phone):)It's a small brown paper bag, Ma.

4
00:00:17,109 --> 00:00:20,069
(Howard(into phone):)I'm looking at it right now.

5
00:00:20,321 --> 00:00:24,911
Why would I make that up?
There's no Ding Dong in it.

6
00:00:26,785 --> 00:00:30,955
How are two Ding Dongs tomorrow
gonna help me today?

7
00:00:32,416 --> 00:00:35,506
(Sheldon(entering):)So this is Engineering, huh?

8
00:00:35,669 --> 00:00:37,799
(Howard(into phone):)I'll talk to you later.

9
00:00:37,963 --> 00:00:40,713
(Sheldon(entering):)Engineering,
where the noble semiskilled laborers...

10
00:00:40,883 --> 00:00:43,763
(Sheldon:)...execute the vision
of those who think and dream.

11
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:47,010
Hello, Oompa Loompas of science.

12
00:00:49,475 --> 00:00:51,395
(Howard:)Sheldon, what are you doing here?

13
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:53,810
(Sheldon:)I just came by to say hello.

14
00:00:53,979 --> 00:00:56,649
(Howard:)For three years,
you've never come by to say hello.

15
00:00:56,815 --> 00:01:00,025
(Sheldon:)Well, up until now,
I've had better things to do.

